abstract: "A curated, standardized collection of 49 empirical phylogenetic datasets covering 47 taxonomic groups across Bacteria, Archaea, and Eukaryota. Provides tip-label normalized Newick trees with numeric identifiers, a global species dictionary (637,619 unique standardized labels), full label mappings, and metadata. Companion to Richter (2026) Systematic Biology."
